{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spirit of the Obelisk is a mind-bending puzzle platformer that will challenge your wits and test your coordination. Master the unique abilities of four distinct characters as you solve increasingly complex puzzles across vibrant, themed worlds. Play alone or with a friend and solve the puzzles of the Spirit of the Obelisk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/heroes_header.png?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between heroes on the fly, each with their own special ability. Recall position, defy gravity, teleport to your slug companion and link movement to others. The abilities combined with themed puzzle elements make sure every level feels fresh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/blue_gif.gif?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/coop_header.png?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you prefer to play alone or with a friend, you will have to think like a team to position your characters and combine their abilities effectively. In single-player mode, you can switch between characters to solve puzzles and navigate levels. In co-op mode, you and a friend can control two characters simultaneously, requiring even more coordination and teamwork to overcome challenges. The game supports both local co-op and steam play together, allowing you to team up with friends no matter where they are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/red_gif.gif?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/themed_header.png?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through five distinct environments, each introducing new themed mechanics which will push your problem-solving skills to the limit. From the nautical world of the Diver to the desert of the Mechanic, each world has its own unique challenges and obstacles to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/green_gif.gif?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/challenges_header.png?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt for challenging or hidden artifacts in each level for an extra test of skill. Every level features a collectible that is obtained through a platforming challenge, a more difficult solution of the puzzle, or is hidden altogether. You can also try your luck in the speedrunning and gauntlet modes for more replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/yellow_gif_2.gif?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you guide the four heroes through each level? Dive into Spirit of the Obelisk and put your puzzle-solving skills to the ultimate test!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tranquil Trial Valley","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147370/59f1ddafe1ca6351fdce74ec3c3595019487072f.jpg"},{"name":"Barnacle Bay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147370/e448db70b05b310994632ca104cec17f5036df18.jpg"},{"name":"Mecha-Miner Mountain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147370/10f23b1dc50b94686889532dd6997c528aa699dc.jpg"},{"name":"Jumble Bumble Jungle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147370/4421773a80ad8793dba06d1aa5e788d6f7f54cf0.jpg"},{"name":"Dynamo desert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147370/810965a9aebbbdf9b866cd712f9b3f19c8e00e2d.jpg"},{"name":"Not so Tranquil Trial Valley","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147370/119bd6677c16432b71506272484c120042a55fce.jpg"},{"name":"Barnicle Bay Boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147370/cdfe67ad350cb03fd09831a2e5e55d091fcf8258.jpg"},{"name":"Engineering Degree","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147370/04ba578ab0b066402bcd070aeb7ddfe35cb8fa59.jpg"},{"name":"King of the Jungle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147370/bab4beaaa5bb7f9e8bdf2080c729a2a65429ed45.jpg"},{"name":"Shocking discovery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147370/4527285b5b164725c5adb16fc54f9db74b3245f9.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3147370?t=1743620240","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3147370?t=1743620240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743620240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743620240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3253880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spirit of the Obelisk is a mind-bending puzzle platformer that will challenge your wits and test your coordination. Master the unique abilities of four distinct characters as you solve increasingly complex puzzles across vibrant, themed worlds. Play alone or with a friend and solve the puzzles of the Spirit of the Obelisk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/heroes_header.png?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between heroes on the fly, each with their own special ability. Recall position, defy gravity, teleport to your slug companion and link movement to others. The abilities combined with themed puzzle elements make sure every level feels fresh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/blue_gif.gif?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/coop_header.png?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you prefer to play alone or with a friend, you will have to think like a team to position your characters and combine their abilities effectively. In single-player mode, you can switch between characters to solve puzzles and navigate levels. In co-op mode, you and a friend can control two characters simultaneously, requiring even more coordination and teamwork to overcome challenges. The game supports both local co-op and steam play together, allowing you to team up with friends no matter where they are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/red_gif.gif?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/themed_header.png?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through five distinct environments, each introducing new themed mechanics which will push your problem-solving skills to the limit. From the nautical world of the Diver to the desert of the Mechanic, each world has its own unique challenges and obstacles to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/green_gif.gif?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/challenges_header.png?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt for challenging or hidden artifacts in each level for an extra test of skill. Every level features a collectible that is obtained through a platforming challenge, a more difficult solution of the puzzle, or is hidden altogether. You can also try your luck in the speedrunning and gauntlet modes for more replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147370/extras/yellow_gif_2.gif?t=1743620240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you guide the four heroes through each level? Dive into Spirit of the Obelisk and put your puzzle-solving skills to the ultimate test!</p>","developers":["Joost van der Putten"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/314